154
00:05:22.923 --> 00:05:23.188
floor.

155
00:05:23.452 --> 00:05:25.436
XMIDI was split by the fingerprint itself,

156
00:05:25.436 --> 00:05:27.421
so it reads zero by construction, and with

157
00:05:27.421 --> 00:05:29.317
no song IDs nothing independent is left to

158
00:05:29.317 --> 00:05:30.066
measure the leak.

159
00:05:30.331 --> 00:05:32.271
It is not measured, and most likely above

160
00:05:32.271 --> 00:05:32.491
zero.

161
00:05:32.926 --> 00:05:35.388
For the report, that is the sentence:

162
00:05:35.388 --> 00:05:37.850
split by melodic-twin clusters, zero twins

163
00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:40.312
at the rule by construction, the remaining

164
00:05:40.312 --> 00:05:41.188
